{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2021-05-12 10:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN ISSUES $500 MILLION OF GREEN BONDS TO FUND SUSTAINABLE BUSINESS INITIATIVES', 'text': "NORFOLK, VA., MAY 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) TODAY CLOSED A $500 MILLION GREEN BOND OFFERING TO FUND INVESTMENTS TO REDUCE THE COMPANY'S CARBON EMISSIONS AND HELP CUSTOMERS REDUCE THEIR SUPPLY-CHAIN EMISSIONS."}